[aimspice]
[description]
1147
NOR2 leakage - stacking comparison
.include p18_cmos_models_ff.inc

VDD vdd 0 0.55

* Worst-case logic levels that follow VDD
EHI hi 0 vdd 0 0.75
ELO lo 0 vdd 0 0.25

* Normal NOR2: series PMOS (a on the upper PMOS), parallel NMOS
.subckt norn y a b vdd
MPA m a vdd vdd PMOS W=0.18U L=0.36U
MPB y b m vdd PMOS W=0.18U L=0.36U
MNA y a 0 0 NMOS W=0.18U L=0.36U
MNB y b 0 0 NMOS W=0.18U L=0.36U
.ends

* NMOS-stacked NOR2: each NMOS replaced by two in series
.subckt nors y a b vdd
MPA m a vdd vdd PMOS W=0.18U L=0.36U
MPB y b m vdd PMOS W=0.18U L=0.36U
MNA1 y a na 0 NMOS W=0.18U L=0.36U
MNA2 na a 0 0 NMOS W=0.18U L=0.36U
MNB1 y b nb 0 NMOS W=0.18U L=0.36U
MNB2 nb b 0 0 NMOS W=0.18U L=0.36U
.ends

* Normal: AB = 00, 01, 10, 11
VN00 vdd dn00 0
XN00 yn00 lo lo dn00 norn
VN01 vdd dn01 0
XN01 yn01 lo hi dn01 norn
VN10 vdd dn10 0
XN10 yn10 hi lo dn10 norn
VN11 vdd dn11 0
XN11 yn11 hi hi dn11 norn

* NMOS-stacked: AB = 00, 01, 10, 11
VS00 vdd ds00 0
XS00 ys00 lo lo ds00 nors
VS01 vdd ds01 0
XS01 ys01 lo hi ds01 nors
VS10 vdd ds10 0
XS10 ys10 hi lo ds10 nors
VS11 vdd ds11 0
XS11 ys11 hi hi ds11 nors

[end]
